<title>SOUTH AFRICA: LA Retail half yr share 10.65 cts.</title>
<headline>LA Retail half yr share 10.65 cts.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Headline shr (cts)    10.65	 vs 183.00</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     10.65	 vs 1,456</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    2.29	 vs 9.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    3.55	 vs 9.62</p>
<p>    Tax			  1.24	 vs 0.001</p>
<p>    Interest received	0.70	 vs 0.09 paid</p>
<p>    Turnover		  23.47	 vs 9.02</p>
<p>Full name: LA Retail Stores Ltd (clothing retailer)</p>
<p>* Results are compared to those for the eight months ended August 31, 1996. The company listed on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange October 14.</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said its acquisition of footwear distributor Skye would boost earnings in the second half of the year and that at least two new stores would be opened this year. It expected to be able to achieve its forecast earnings of 19.08 cents a share for the full year.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
